{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyss Depth: Control \u2013 Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included in this Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>first in-game day</strong> set inside the main control station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable <strong>console, lever, and sonar systems</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One <strong>diver protection sequence</strong> \u2014 use light to defend the diver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial <strong>voice lines</strong> and dialogue with your instructor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>English subtitles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player, point-and-click interface.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Included in this Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later missions, new environments, and story progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional diver encounters and threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system and long-term consequence mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other languages, achievements, or multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man trapped by crushing debt inside an underwater habitat, where survival means obedience. <br>What looked like an opportunity for freedom turns out to be a prison of routine, isolation, and impossible choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyss Depth: Control</strong> is a <strong>point-and-click horror </strong> set 2000 meters beneath the ocean:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point and click to survive</strong> \u2013 Operate consoles, levers, and terminals in a claustrophobic station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depression and control</strong> \u2013 Each task feels simple, but failure has immediate consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the diver</strong> \u2013 A lone diver depends on your light to keep them alive outside the station. Fail, and they never come back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong> \u2013 Who survives, and what the abyss takes from you, depends on your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you\u2019re not an adventurer\u2014you\u2019re a worker. And your only reward for survival is another shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new orders. Every mistake has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the deep, the only thing more dangerous than the unknown is failing the people who still depend on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pull The Lever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092930/extras/0abec4aba545367a5585eb09d78bf53a.poster.avif?t=1760550561\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092930/extras/0abec4aba545367a5585eb09d78bf53a.webm?t=1760550561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push the Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092930/extras/e81e448ef72b7dd9fb46e79f064daa27.poster.avif?t=1760550561\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092930/extras/e81e448ef72b7dd9fb46e79f064daa27.webm?t=1760550561\